---
title: OMCS thin adaptive delivery pipeline
---
flowchart LR
    A[Intent] --> B[Thin route]
    B --> C[Direct work by default]
    C --> D{Named trigger?}
    D -- skill or auxiliary earned --> E[Focused work]
    D -- no --> F[Final verification]
    E --> F
    F --> G{Fresh review required?}
    G -- yes --> H[Independent review]
    G -- no --> I[Stop after green]
    H --> I
